stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Listed : list()
    Listed --> Deactivated : deactivate()
    Listed --> Sold : buy() + confirm()
    Deactivated --> [*]

    state "Licence Issued" as LI
    Sold --> LI : confirm() mints ERC-1155
    LI --> [*] : licence held by buyer

    note right of Listed
        Asset exists on-chain with
        commitments (hD, hC, R_D, R_C, cK).
        active = true.
    end note

    note right of LI
        ERC-1155 token minted to buyer.
        Balance = number of licences.
        Metadata encodes scope/duration.
        Does NOT transfer content ownership.
    end note
